y data collection periods using a nondecreasing composite estimation procedure\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Differences were determined using t-tests with p-values <0.05 considered statistically significant.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Data are weighted to represent the noninstitutionalized U.S. population.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}